␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀qh_test_centrum_merge: concave f%d to coplanar f%d, dist %4.4g and reverse dist %4.4g, angle %4.4g during p%d
␀␀qh_test_centrum_merge: concave f%d to f%d, dist %4.4g and reverse dist %4.4g, angle %4.4g during p%d
